                    },
                    "tone_str": "Empathy",
                    "playerLine": "Thank you. I don't know why, but I feel like you truly care about my survival."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pid": "saori_device_given",
            "name": "Saori's Warning",
            "conversationId": "saori_encounter_01",
            "text": "The market is not what it seems. They will try to use you. Use the device—and use your voice to resist them.",
            "required_flags": [],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "(T) I will. I won't let them control me.",
                    "target": "saori_departure",
                    "shared_beat": "Then we will meet again. When the time is right.",
                    "system_trigger": "",
                    "data_hook": "saori_warned=true|saori_will_return=true",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Trust",
                                "value": 0.02
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Trust",
                    "playerLine": "I will. I won't let them control me."
                },
                {
                    "text": "(O) Use my voice? What does that mean exactly?",
                    "target": "saori_departure",
                    "shared_beat": "Your emotional resonance. The tone of your choices. That is your voice. And it matters.",
                    "system_trigger": "",
                    "data_hook": "saori_warned=true|tone_system_explained=true",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Observation",
                                "value": 0.02
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Observation",
                    "playerLine": "Use my voice? What does that mean exactly?"
                },
                {
                    "text": "(N) The market is just the beginning, isn't it? There's something larger happening.",
                    "target": "saori_departure",
                    "shared_beat": "You see clearly. That will serve you well.",
                    "system_trigger": "",
                    "data_hook": "saori_warned=true|player_aware=true",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "NarrativePresence",
                                "value": 0.03
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "NarrativePresence",
                    "playerLine": "The market is just the beginning, isn't it? There's something larger happening."
                },
                {
                    "text": "(E) I'm afraid. But I'm more determined now than ever to understand what's happening.",
                    "target": "saori_departure",
                    "shared_beat": "Fear is wisdom. Use it. You are not alone in this.",
                    "system_trigger": "",
                    "data_hook": "saori_warned=true|saori_support_pledged=true",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Empathy",
                                "value": 0.03
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "npc_resonance": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Saori",
                                "value": 0.04
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Empathy",
                    "playerLine": "I'm afraid. But I'm more determined now than ever to understand what's happening."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pid": "saori_departure",
            "name": "Saori's Farewell",
            "conversationId": "saori_encounter_01",
            "text": "Go to the market. Let fate guide your next steps. But remember what I have told you.",
            "required_flags": [],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "(T) Wait—what's your name?",
                    "target": "saori_encounter_01_dismissal",
                    "shared_beat": "I am Saori. And you will understand, when understanding becomes necessary.",
                    "system_trigger": "diary_update",
                    "data_hook": "saori_name_learned=true|append_diary:Met an older woman in the desert. She gave me a strange device and warned me about the market. There is something greater at play here—something she knows but will not fully reveal. I feel like our meeting was no accident.",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Trust",
                                "value": 0.01
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Trust",
                    "playerLine": "Wait—what's your name?"
                },
                {
                    "text": "(O) How will I find you again?",
                    "target": "saori_encounter_01_dismissal",
                    "shared_beat": "My name is Saori. When the time is right, we will find each other.",
                    "system_trigger": "diary_update",
                    "data_hook": "saori_name_learned=true|append_diary:Met an older woman in the desert. She gave me a device and disappeared into the storm. She spoke cryptically about fate and timing. I have so many unanswered questions. Her name is Saori.",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Observation",
                                "value": 0.01
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Observation",
                    "playerLine": "How will I find you again?"
                },
                {
                    "text": "(N) This meeting feels written in the stars somehow. Like it was always meant to be.",
                    "target": "saori_encounter_01_dismissal",
                    "shared_beat": "Perhaps it was. Or perhaps we are writing it together, one choice at a time.",
                    "system_trigger": "diary_update",
                    "data_hook": "saori_name_learned=true|append_diary:Saori—that is her name. She vanished into the desert like a phantom, but I know I will see her again. Our destinies are entwined somehow.",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "NarrativePresence",
                                "value": 0.02
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "NarrativePresence",
                    "playerLine": "This meeting feels written in the stars somehow. Like it was always meant to be."
                },
                {
                    "text": "(E) You've changed me already. Thank you for believing in me, even though we just met.",
                    "target": "saori_encounter_01_dismissal",
                    "shared_beat": "We are more connected than you know. Trust yourself.",
                    "system_trigger": "diary_update",
                    "data_hook": "saori_name_learned=true|append_diary:Saori. She trusted me. She believed in me. I don't know what the future holds, but I know I will honor that trust. We will meet again.",
                    "tone_effects": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Empathy",
                                "value": 0.02
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "npc_resonance": {
                        "entries": [
                            {
                                "key": "Saori",
                                "value": 0.06
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "tone_str": "Empathy",
                    "playerLine": "You've changed me already. Thank you for believing in me, even though we just met."
                }
            ]
        },
